Changes made in RustGIS-SwatPlus, relative to upstream RustGIS:

- Heights and measures (Z/M) on vector data: read and written for Shapefiles,
  GeoJSON and WKB (crates/data).
- A reader for JAXA GSMaP rain grids (crates/data/src/raster/gsmap.rs).
- Rain commands: rain.style, rain.accumulate, rain.zonal (crates/engine/src/cmd/rain.rs).
- SWAT+ model commands for the assistant: swat.open, swat.check, swat.get,
  swat.set, swat.save and others (crates/engine/src/cmd/swat.rs), with the
  swat-model and swat-edit skills (crates/assistant/skills).
- No Dependabot: dependency updates come from upstream when it is merged in.
- Workflows that deploy, release or publish for upstream run only in
  opengeos/RustGIS.

GSMaP data are provided by JAXA under its own terms and are not part of this
repository.
